# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: SiblingHintHonestSplitHintWithoutBound
TARGET: SiblingHintHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the split hands the sibling the heads with no bound check: main's split hint, #5752
PERTURBS: SplitCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitHint = TRUE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ sh[a] # -1
    /\ SplitViewClear(a)
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ CloseCarried => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ sh[a] # -1
\* MUTATION: no view and no bounds.
--- END
